  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41301" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to implementation of the Regional Plan of Action to deter and eliminate Illegal, Unreported</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support harmonization of the WECAFC fishing vessel record with the Global Record.
2.	Formalize the arrangements with TMTracking to maintain an IUU vessel lists for WECAFC and a record of authorized foreign fishing and transport vessels that are allowed to be active in WECAFC mandate area, similarly as they do for many RFMOs.
3.	Contribute to the RFMO establishment process in the WECAFC area, through financing participation of SIDS delegates to the 2nd preparatory meeting on the establishment of an RFMO in the WECAFC area.</narrative>
  </description>
